{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PHP",
  "chapter": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Paul and Timothy, the servants of Jesus Christ, to all the saints in Christ Jesus who are at Philippi, with the bishops and deacons:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grace ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to you, and peace, from God our Father and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I thank my God upon every remembrance of you,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Always in every prayer of mine for you all making request with joy,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For your fellowship in the gospel from the first day until now;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Being confident of this very thing, that he who hath begun a good work in you, will perform ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " until the day of Jesus Christ:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even as it is meet for me to think this of you all, because I have you in my heart; inasmuch as both in my bonds, and in the defense and confirmation of the gospel, ye all are partakers of my grace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For God is my witness, how greatly I long after you all in the bowels of Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And this I pray, that your love may abound yet more and more in knowledge and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all judgment;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That ye may approve things that are excellent; that ye may be sincere and without offense till the day of Christ;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Being filled with the fruits of righteousness, which are by Jesus Christ, to the glory and praise of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I would ye should understand, brethren, that the things ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which happened",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to me have fallen out rather to the furtherance of the gospel;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So that my bonds in Christ are manifest in all the palace, and in all other ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "places",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ";",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And many of the brethren in the Lord, becoming confident by my bonds, are much more bold to speak the word without fear.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Some indeed preach Christ even from envy and strife; and some also from good will.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The one preach Christ from contention, not sincerely, supposing to add affliction to my bonds:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the other from love, knowing that I am set for the defense of the gospel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What then? notwithstanding, every way, whether in pretense or in truth, Christ is preached; and I therein do rejoice, yes, and will rejoice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I know that this will turn to my salvation through your prayer, and the supply of the Spirit of Jesus Christ,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "According to my earnest expectation and hope, that in nothing I shall be ashamed, but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with all boldness, as always, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " now also, Christ will be magnified in my body, whether by life, or by death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For to me to live ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Christ, and to die ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " gain.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if I live in the flesh, this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the fruit of my labor: yet what I shall choose I know not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I am in a strait betwixt two, having a desire to depart, and to be with Christ; which is far better:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, to abide in the flesh ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " more needful for you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And having this confidence, I know that I shall abide and continue with you all for your furtherance and joy of faith;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That your rejoicing for me may be more abundant in Jesus Christ by my coming to you again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Only let your manner of life be as it becometh the gospel of Christ: that whether I come and see you, or else be absent, I may hear of your affairs, that ye stand fast in one spirit, with one mind striving together for the faith of the gospel;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in nothing terrified by your adversaries: which is to them an evident token of perdition, but to you of salvation, and that from God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For to you it is given in the behalf of Christ, not only to believe on him, but also to suffer for his sake;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PHP.1.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PHP.1.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Having the same conflict which ye saw in me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " now hear ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
